Thanks for visiting my website. I am trying to get this section to be a place
where I actually put things I'm thinking about. I got it so that it can display
math like $e^(i pi) + 1 = 0$ inline, or displayed:

$ sum_(k=0)^n binom(n, k) = 2^n $

I can also do cool footnotes.#footnote[
  I love to write footnotes. Hopefully this works well!
]
Will I learn to make it do other weird things? Hopefully. I am going to need
some graphs and pictures eventually for sure.

These thoughts won't necessarily be particularly polished, but I hope the idea
that these notes will be out there, in the world, will provide me some pressure
to write things up at least somewhat sensibly. This is more for my sake than
anyone else's, but feel free to reach out if you ever find anything interesting
on here.
